{"id":"21b7bd1c8fd4","path":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/budget","lang":"en","title":"Budget of the Corporation","description":"Every year, USI allocates funds to the Corporation based on the total number of students enrolled in Bachelor's and Master's programmes. This budget is meant to support proposals by the student associations as well as the Corporation's own projects.","section":"University","crumbs":["University","Organisation","Student Corporation","Discover"],"image":null,"words":153,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/organizzazione/corporazione-studentesca/budget","en":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/budget"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"University","path":"/en/originalnode/8524"},{"label":"Organisation","path":"/en/originalnode/8519"},{"label":"Student Corporation","path":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation"},{"label":"Discover","path":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/discover"},{"label":"Budget of the Corporation","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p><strong>Every year, USI allocates funds to the Corporation based on the total number of students enrolled in Bachelor's and Master's programmes. This budget is meant to support proposals by the student associations as well as the Corporation's own projects.</strong></p> <p>According to the rules in place, decisions on how to use the budget are made in the first instance by the Student Council, the &quot;government&quot; of the Corporation. The student body as a whole makes up the Corporation's &quot;sovereign&quot;, called the &quot;Student General Assembly&quot;. Through &quot;direct democracy&quot; in the form of voting, the student body therefore can have a say in the Council's final spending decisions<br> – <a href=\"/en/originalnode/16809\">click here for more information on how the Corporation works</a>.</p> <p>The actual budget that USI allocates to the Corporation is set each year for the following year, as part of the University's financial planning process (the Corporation has a budget of approximately CHF 10 per student). </p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Student Corporation","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation"},{"label":"How it works","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/how-it-works"},{"label":"Structure","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/structure"},{"label":"Direct democracy","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/direct-democracy"},{"label":"Budget","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/budget"},{"label":"Run for / elect","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/candidates-elections"},{"label":"Initiatives","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/initiatives"},{"label":"Referendums","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/referendums"},{"label":"Vote","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/voting"},{"label":"Submit an idea","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/submitting-ideas"},{"label":"Monitoring","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/participate/monitoring"},{"label":"List of Decisions","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/list-of-decisions"},{"label":"List of Initiatives","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/list-of-initiatives"},{"label":"List of Referendums","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/list-of-referendums"},{"label":"Calendar","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/student-corporation-calendar"},{"label":"Student Corporation news","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/student-corporation-news"},{"label":"Newsletter","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/updates/newsletter"},{"label":"For student associations","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/for-associations"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/faq"}],"links":[{"label":"corporazione-studentesca@usi.ch","href":"mailto:corporazione-studentesca@usi.ch"},{"label":"About the Study Corporation","href":"/en/university/organisation/student-corporation"}],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/organisation/student-corporation/budget","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T19:07:58.832Z"}